*SPEF "IEEE 1481-1999"
*DESIGN "fixture_top"
*DATE "not a run artefact - hand-authored fixture"
*VENDOR "vibe-ic regression fixture"
*PROGRAM "hand-authored"
*VERSION "1.0"
*DESIGN_FLOW "NETLIST_TYPE_VERILOG"
*DIVIDER /
*DELIMITER :
*BUS_DELIMITER []
*T_UNIT 1 NS
*C_UNIT 1 PF
*R_UNIT 1 OHM
*L_UNIT 1 HENRY

*NAME_MAP
*1 net_a
*2 net_b

*D_NET *1 0.3
*CONN
*I ua:Z O *D BUF
*I ua:B I *D DFF
*CAP
1 ua:Z 0.1
2 ua:B 0.1
3 ub:A ua:B 0.1
*RES
1 ua:Z ua:B 10
*END

*D_NET *2 0.2
*CONN
*I ub:Z O *D BUF
*I ub:A I *D DFF
*CAP
1 ub:Z 0.1
2 ub:A 0.1
*RES
1 ub:Z ub:A 10
*END
